  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 3.25,
      "end": 7.25,
      "text": "We are frequently told that American politics are polarized.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115776,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015884
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 7.25,
      "end": 11.25,
      "text": "On the right, Republicans work together with other Republicans.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115776,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015884
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 11.25,
      "end": 15.25,
      "text": "And on the left, Democrats work with other Democrats.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115776,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015884
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 15.25,
      "end": 19.25,
      "text": "But Republicans and Democrats don't usually work with each other.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115776,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015884
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 19.25,
      "end": 23.25,
      "text": "Polarization means that politics is us and them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115776,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015884
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 23.25,
      "end": 28.25,
      "text": "To understand how bad it actually is, a professor at Michigan State University",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115776,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015884
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 28.25,
      "end": 33.25,
      "text": "looked at the networks of every U.S. Senator and Representative since 1973.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 33.25,
      "end": 38.25,
      "text": "In the 1970s and 80s, the Democrats mostly worked together,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 38.25,
      "end": 40.25,
      "text": "and the Republicans mostly worked together.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 40.25,
      "end": 45.25,
      "text": "But they still sometimes worked across the aisle to pass important legislation.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 45.25,
      "end": 47.25,
      "text": "Here's what it looks like now.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 47.25,
      "end": 51.25,
      "text": "The Democrats and Republicans almost never worked together.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 51.25,
      "end": 57.25,
      "text": "We've been moving towards this kind of polarization in both the Senate and the House since the 1970s.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033051
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 57.25,
      "end": 62.25,
      "text": "But polarization can be even stronger when Republicans and Democrats",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05004,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 62.25,
      "end": 65.25,
      "text": "actually try to undermine and attack each other.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05004,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 65.25,
      "end": 70.25,
      "text": "When this happens, polarization becomes us versus them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05004,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 70.25,
      "end": 75.25,
      "text": "This research shows that even the stronger us versus them polarization",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05004,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 75.25,
      "end": 78.25,
      "text": "has gotten much worse over the past 40 years.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05004,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 78.25,
      "end": 82.25,
      "text": "It's also shown that it doesn't matter which party is in control.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05004,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001838
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 82.25,
      "end": 89.25,
      "text": "American politics have grown more polarized under both Republican and Democratic-controlled Congresses.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.541992
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 89.25,
      "end": 92.25,
      "text": "It's time for a change.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.541992
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 92.25,
      "end": 95.25,
      "text": "To learn more about this research, check it out online.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.093192,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.541992
    }
  ],
